    "updated_at": "2022-05-28T20:00:07Z",
    "body": "I don't think this is an issue with starship: if you execute any other binary, do you get this message?\r\n\r\nIf so, then something else has gone wrong with the system configuration, and fixing that will also fix this issue. The init scripts for starship don't touch these platform variables, so I don't think they can cause this issue on their own.",
