    "updated_at": "2022-06-07T15:59:25Z",
    "body": "I found this https://bugs.launchpad.net/snapd/+bug/1907237 and a related PR here https://github.com/snapcore/snapd/pull/9767\r\n\r\nother projects have the same issue https://github.com/uglide/viber-unofficial-snap/issues/14\r\nhttps://github.com/aristocratos/bashtop/issues/202\r\n\r\nBut I think you are right – looks like it's a problem with snap – not starship. \r\nTheir issue tracking is impenetrable though",
