    "updated_at": "2022-06-07T19:43:22Z",
    "body": "It looks like the fix was committed in December 2020, but based on typical Debian/Ubuntu release cycles, it might not make it into a production system for a while still.\r\n\r\nWhat OS are you running? It seems your bug-report is bugged (#3936 is the issue) so it claims you're using OracleLinux, but I don't think that exists for RPi.",
